 },
 {
  "work_id": "w_R4HB857E1N43",
  "campo": "sinopsis.en",
  "valor": "How can we imagine a story of revenge and liberation through cinema? Amid manipulated, re-woven images from post-revolutionary Iranian cinema, the secrets of plants, control over the body, and love between women surface. At once remedy and poison, a poetics of revenge as escape and antidote to oppression.",
